Activity Detail:
1) Provide technical advice on safe construction to NRA beneficiaries and distribute approved NRA documentation;
2) Establish accessible technical support centers for Surakshit Ghar App users, to which they can come to get additional face-to-face technical assistance, including design services;
3) Provide remote technical assistance to Surakshit Ghar App users who live in the Municipalities where the centers are located; 
4) Provide safe house designs to NRA beneficiaries living the the Municipalities where the centers are located;

